<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Nehemiah</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hakaliah tapa Nehemiah thute; kum sawmnina kum, Kisleu ha in, susa leeng innpi a ka um lai in, hichi ahing hi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sanggamte mi khat Hanani leh mi pawl khat Juda gam a kipat ahing pei uhi. Ken amaute kungah, sal a puimanga umlou a nuasie a um sun Judate tungtang thu leh Jerusalem tungtang thu kana dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaun ka kungah, “Sal a pui a umlou a nuasie a suohta sun, tua gam a um nalaite, gim thuohna nasatah leh zum leh simmaw in a um ua, Jerusalem kulbangte lah suhchip in a uma, akotpite mei in akatumta hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam thute ka zahtah in ka tou suh a ka kapta hi, ni bangza ahiei sung hasie in ann ka ngawl a, van Pasian mai ah ka thumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aw Mangpa Van Pasian, Pasian thupi leh zauhuoi, Nang hing it a, na thupiehte zui mite toh kaal a itna thuhun kem ngitngetpa aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />na suohpa’n na mi Israelte a dinga tu a, asun azan a, na masanga ka thumna za dingin, na bil hing daw inlen, na mit hah sah in, Israel taten na tunga ka khelnate uh thupha ka hing tawi uhi. Kei leh ka pa innkuonte kana khielta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na tungah giloutahin Kana gamta ua, na suoh Mosi kunga na thupiehte, na thugousiete leh na vaihawmna dan thute kana zuita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na suoh Mosi kunga na thupieh; Na muonhuoi sih ua ahileh namte lah ah ka hing thethang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh ka kunga na hing kile kia ua, ka thupiehte na zui ua na bawl u’leh, vantawp gamlapen tan a nawdohin umnan ulachin zong, tuana kipat in amauh ka khawm dinga, ka min umna dinga ka telna mun ngei ah ka puikhawm kia ding hi, na chi thute thei ngitnget dingin ka hing ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamte na silbawltheina nasatah leh na khut hat a na tatsa na suohte leh na mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mangpa aw, ka hing ngen ahi, hepitahin na suohpa thumna leh na suohte thugetna na bil in za henlen na min zatat nuom na suohte langah na bil hing daw inlen, tuni’n tam mipa mitmu in na deisahna hing pie inlen, hing lawching sahin. Khum hun lai in kei leengpa nou dompa ka hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Artekserses vaihawm kum sawmnina kum Nisan ha in, leengpa mai ah uoin a um a: tuakhu kala a leengpa ka pie hi. Amai ah nidangin damel ka pokha ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuazieh in leengpa’n ka kungah, “Adammaw lah na hi vawtsin, bangzieh a damel puo na hiei? Tam pen lungtang dana loungal bangma dang ahisih hi,” achia, tuachi’n kei ka zau mamata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ken leengpa kungah, “Leengpa dam sawt hen, ka pu ka pate kivuina khopi susiet gawp in a um a, akawtpite mei in akatum sienga, bang zieh a damel louthei ding ka hiei?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa’n ka kungah, “Bang na ngen ut ei?” a hing chi a, tuachi’n van Pasian kungah ka thum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuachi’n leengpa kungah, “Leengpa’n pha nasah a, na suohpan na mitmu a deisahna katan leh Juda gam ah kapu ka pate kivuina khopi ka lamtha theina dingin hing sawl dingin ka’ng ngen hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lengpa’n ka kungah (Lengnu zong akungah atou a) “Na khuolzin sung bang tan a sawt ding ahiei? tualeh bangchih chienga hing kile kia ding na hiei?” chi’n ahing dong hi. Tuachi’n leengpa’n ahing sawl ding pha asah ziehin, Ken ahun bihieh khat leengpa ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n leengpa kungah, “Lengpa’n pha na sahleh, Juda gam ka tun masangsie a bittah a ka pei suoh theina dingin, luipi gal gam a uhpipate ading laihah hing tawi sah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tualeh leengpa gammang kempa Asaph in biehinn kul kotpite a ding, khopi kulbaang ading leh ka umna ding inn ading singtunte ahing pieh theina dingin ama lai ding hing tawi sah in,” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n ka Pasian hepina khut ka tunga aum ziehin leengpa’n ka ngette ahing phal pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Luipi gal gam a uhpipate kungah ka hing tunga, a kung uah leengpa laihahte ka pie hi. Lengpa’n galkap lamkaite leh sakol tungtuong miten zong kei ahing zui sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Horon mi Sanballat leh Ammon mite ulien Tobiah in tam thu azah tah un, Israel mite hoina ding sui ding mi khat ahing tungta chi azah tah un, apatau mamata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem ka hing tunga, tuanah nithum ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n zanlai in ka thou khie a, mi phabepkhat toh ka kithuo a, Jerusalem bawl dingdan ka Pasian in ka lungtanga akoi khu koima ka hil sih hi; atunga ka tuonna ganta chilou ka kungah ganta khat zong a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zanlai in ka pawtdoh a, phaiguom kotpi zui in ka pei a, dragon tuikul leh eehvum kotpi ka tunga, Jerusalem kulbang chimsate leh mei kahtumsa kotpite ka en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuinah kotpi leh leengpa dil manaw in ka pei a, hinanleh ka tuonna ganta pei theina ding mun a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n zanlai in phaiguom zui in ka peitou a, kulbangte ka vel hi. Tuachi’n ka kinuale kia a, phaiguom kotpi ah ka lut a, ka hing kile-kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaihawmte leh mi lienten, hei a pei a, bang ahiei ka bawl, chi athei sih uhi, aziehpen tam thu Judate kungah hitaleh siempute leh miliente tualeh vaihawm mite leh nasem dingte kung hitaleh koima kungah ka hil nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute kungah, “I din mun asiet dan na mu ua, Jerusalem asiet gawp dan leh a kotpite mei in akatumta chi namu uhi, kisa un, simmaw a ium nawnlou na ding un, Jerusalem kulbaangte lamtha kia vai,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka tunga ka Pasian hepina khut a um dan leh leengpa’n ka kunga agen thute zong amaute ka hil hi. “Tuachi’n amauten kisa vai in kulbang ilam ding uhi,” achi uhi. Tuachi’n na hoi sem dingin akhutte uh asuhatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh Horon mi Sanballat leh Ammon mite ulien Tobiah leh Arab mi Geshem in, tam thu azah tahun, simmaw leh enghou in ahing nuisan ua, “Bang bawla kinei nahi uoi? Lengpa tunga hel sawm na hi uoi mah?” ahing chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken amauh ka dawnga, “Van Pasian in koute ahing lawching sah ding hi, tuaziehin ama suoh koute, ka kipanta ding ua, ka lam ding uhi, hinanleh noute’n Jerusalem ah tanvou ahiei, thuneina ahiei, nou a na chi thei ding u’zong na nei sih uhi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Siempu lien Aliashib leh asiempu hipite toh akipan ua, belam kotpi alamtha uhi. Asiensuona abawl ua, akotkhate a thuo uhi, Zakhat innsang dong leh Hananeel innsang tan dong alam ua, asiensuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ban ah Jerikou miten alam ua, tualeh amaute ban ah Imri tapa Zakkur in alam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hassenaah tapaten Nga kotpi alam ua, amauten ainnkam zawlte ahung ua, akotkhate akilnate leh akalna zawlte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amauh ban ah Hakkoz tapa Uria tapa Meremoth in abawlpha hi. Amaute ban ah Meshezabeel tapa, Berekiah tapa Meshullam in asiempha hi, tualeh amauh ban ah Ban a tapa Zadok in asiempha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amauh ban ah Tekoa miten abawlpha ua, hinanleh a mi liente un, a Mangpa uh nasepna ah athanuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paseah tapa Joiada leh Besodeiah tapa Meshullam in kotpi lui abawlpha ua, azawlpite hungin akotkhate leh akilnate leh azawlte athuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute ban ah Gibeon mi Melatiah leh Meronoth mi Jadon, Gibeon mi leh Mizpah miten luipi gal gam uhpipa thuneina nuoi a kikoina tandong abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute ban ah sana kheng mite lah Harhaiah tapa Uziel in abawlpha hi. Ama ban ah gimnamtui bawl mi khat Hananiah in abawlpha a, amauten kulbang lienpi dongin Jerusalem kulbang asiempha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute ban ah, Jerusalem gamkai kimkhat a vaihawmpa, Hur tapa Rephaiah in abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute ban ah Harumaph tapa Jedaiah in ama inn toh kimaingat tan abawlpha hi. Ama ban ah Hashabneiah tapa Hattush in abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harim tapa Malkijah leh Pahath-Moab tapa Hashub in mundang leh meikhuh innsang abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaute ban ah, Jerusalem gamkai kimkhat a vaihawmpa Hallohesh tapa Shallum in atanute toh abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hanun leh Zanoah a tengten phaiguom kotpi abawlpha ua alamtha ua, akotkhate leh akilnate leh azawlte abul ua, eehvum kotpi dong kulbang tong tul khat dong asiempha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekab tapa Malkijah, Beth-Hakerem gamkai kimkhat a vaihawmpain Ehvum kotpi abawlpha a, aman alamtha a, akotkhate leh akilnate leh azawlte abul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh tuikhuh kotpi khu Mizpah gamkai kimkhat a vaihawmpa Kol-Hozeh tapa Shallum in abawlpha a, aman alamtha a, akhu khum a, tualeh akotte leh akilnate leh azawlte abul tuoh hi. Lengpa huon gei a Shelah diil kulbang zong abawlpha a, David khopi akipat a chiel kidawsuh dong abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama nua ah, Beth-Zur gamkai kimkhat a vaihawmpa Azbuk tapa Nehemiah in David han toh kimaingat mun dong leh diil kibawlthu leh Mihatte inn tandong a siempha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama nua ah, Bani tapa Rehum lamkaiin Levi miten abawlpha uhi. Ama ban ah Keilah gamkai kimkhat vaihawmpa Hashabiah in ama gamkai sung abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama nua ah Hadad tapa Binnui Keila gamkai kimkhat a danga vaihawmpa lamkai in agammi hipite toh kulbang abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama ban ah Mizpah gam vaihawmpa Jeshua tapa Ezer in mun dang, galvan koina mai a peitouna akipat aningkiu dong abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaute ban ah Zabbai tapa Baruk in tuami ningkiu akipat in siempulien Eliashib inn kotkha dong kulbang sekhen dang khat abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama ban ah, Uria tapa Meremoth in Sekhen dang, Eliashib inn kotkha akipan tua inn tawp dong asiempha hi. Uria khu Hakkoz tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaute ban ah, tua gam mite leh siempute’n abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaute ban ah, Benjamin leh Hashub in amauh inn mazawn abawlpha ua, amaute ban ah Maaseiah tapa Azariah in amauh inn kung abawlpha uhi. Maaseiah khu Anania tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amauh ban ah Henadad tapa Binnui in sekhendang khat Azariah inn akipat kulbang kawina tan, aning tan dongin abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzai tapa Palal in kulbang kawina leh galveng mite inntuol kunga, leengpa a innsang sahta zaw hing dawhkhie zawn a kipat, abawlpha hi. Ama ban ah Parosh tapa Pedaiah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ophel muola teng biehinn a nasemten suolam a, tui kotpi leh innsang dawhkhie zawn tandong abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amaute ban ah, Tekoa miten sekhen dang khat, Ophel kulbanga kipat innsang dawhkhie thupi tandong abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sakol kotpi tunga pat siempute’n amauh inn zawn chiet abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amaute ban ah, Immer tapa Zadok in ama inn zawn abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama ban ah Shelemiah tapa Hananiah leh Zalaph tapa guhna Hanun in Sekhen khat abawlpha uhi. Amaute ban ah, Berekiah tapa Meshullam in ama tenna inn zawn abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama ban ah, sana kheng mi tapa Malkijah in biehinn nasemte leh summet bawl mite inn toh kimaingat a um etdihna kotpi dong leh aninga inndan tungnung tandong abawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh aningkawi a, inndan tungnung leh belam kotpi kikaal pen sana kheng mite leh summetbawl miten abawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh hichi ahi a, Sanballat in kulbang ka lam uh chi azahtah in, alungthah a, athangpai mama a, Judate asimmawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh a unaute mai ah leh Samaria galkapte mai ah: “Tam Juda zawngkhalten bang ahiei abawl uh? Abangte lamtha kia ding uh adiei? Kithoinate anei ding uh adiei? Ni khat sunga lamzou ding uh adiei? Tam baang chimsa leh akagawpsa suong kisievumte bawltha thei kia ding uh adiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualaitah in Ammon mi Tobiah akungah aum a, “Akulbang lamsate uh tungah Si-al nangawn va kaltou leh asuongbangte uh asuchim siengta sih diei,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian uh, hing ngaikhie in, simmaw in ka umta uh, ahing engbawlnate uh amaute lutungah tusah inlen, saltanna gam a gallah vante bangin amauh pekhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Agitlounate uh liekhu sinlen, na mitmu in akhelnate uh nuoimang sin, aziehpen kulbang lam mite mai ah nangma ahing lungthah sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n kulbang ka lam ua, Kulbang lam miten nasep thanopna lungsim anei zieh un, kulbang zousie asanna kimkhat tan dong ka lamtouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Sanballat leh Tobiah tualeh Arab mite, Ammonmite leh Ashdod miten, Jerusalem kulbang akibawltha a, ahawmte akihubit panta chi azah tah un, alungthah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A bawn ua hing kuon a, Jerusalem hing dou leh ka nasep uh hing subuoi dingin thu akikumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka Pasian uh kungah ka thum ua, tualeh amaute apat a sun leh zan a hing veng dingin galveng mite ka koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuabang hunlaitahin Juda in “Nasem mite hatna lah agimgawpta a, van sete lah atam mama nalai a, tuaziehin kulbang lam theilou ka hita uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ka melmate un, “Alah ua iva pei a, i vatha ua, anasep uh itawpsah masangsie’n theilou leh mu theilou ding ahi uh,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaute kim a teng Judate ahing pei ua, sawmvei tah ka kung uah, “Atena mun zousie ua kipat hing dou ding uh ahi,” chiin ahing gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n kulbang nualam a ngiem na munte leh mun awngte ah, a innkuon dung zui un, anamsaute utoh, ateipite u’leh athalpite utoh ka koita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamte ka et kimvel zouin, ka dingdoh a, miliente leh vaihawmte leh mipi dangte kungah, “Amaute zau mawngmawng sih un, athupi leh agiinhuoi mama Mangpa thei ngitnget unlen, na sanggamte u’leh, na tapate u’leh na tanute u’leh na zite u’leh na innte ua dingin galdou un” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka melmate un asil guh bawlte uh kana theikheta uh chi leh Pasian in asil guh bawlte uh alawsam sahta chi athei tahun, ka bawn un kulbang lam a ka nasepna mun chiet uah ka hing kinuale kiata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ni akipat in ka mite kimkhat in nna asem ua, akimkhat in, teipite, lumte, thalte leh awmphawte in akivon uh a, tualeh lamkaite pen Juda innkuonte nua langah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kulbang lam mite leh vansete nawn a puohgih paw miten akhut langkhat ua galvan tawi in, akhut langkhat un nna asem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kulbang lamte zousie in zong alam kawm un apang uah, namsau akuo chiet uhi. Pengkul mutpa pen ka kungah aum ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh milien leh vaihawmte leh mipi dangte kungah, “Nasep athupi in alien a, eite lah kulbang tungah gamla pipi in iki hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Heisung mun ah zong pengkul ging na zah pouma chiengun, koute lam ah hing taikhawm chiet un Pasian in eite a dinga hing doupieh ding ahi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n nna ka sem ua, akimkhatten zingmawng phalvah akipat in aasi hing kilat dong in teipite atawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuami hunlai in zong Ken mipite kungah, “Zan chiengin pasal koizong apanpipa toh Jerusalem khosung ah zan tungtawn in um uheh, zankaal a koute ahing ven ua, sun chienga nna asep theina ding un,” chiin zong ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuazieh in, kei hita leng, kei hing zui ka unaute hitaleh, ka kunga hing zui vengmite hitaleh, koiman ka puonsilte uh ka sut sih ua, michin in azietlam khut uah galvan atawi chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin mipite leh azite uh, a unau Juda te ‘tungah nasatah a lungkim lou in ahing kikouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen pawl khat in “Koute leh ka tapate u’leh ka tanute utoh tampi ka hi ua, ka neh ua ka hin theina ding un bu leh bal ka nga ding uh ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Midang pawl khat ma in lah, “Kiel sunga nehletah ka mu theina dingun, ka loute u’leh ka grep huonte uh tualeh ka innte uh mikhut ah kana koi zouta uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawl khatte leu leu inlah, “Ka loute u’leh ka grep huonte uh mikhut a koi in leengpa kungah sie pieh dingin sum kana bat lah uhi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin ka unaute utoh chi khat sa khat ka hi ua, ka tapate u’zong amauh tapate bang bang ahi uhi. Ahivang in ka tapate u’leh ka tanute uh suoh leh sal dingin ut lou sasa in ka sawlta uh a, ka tanute uh pawlkhat sal in atang zouta uhi, achi uhi. Amauh tatdohna dingin kouten thahatna bangma ka nei sih uhi, aziehpen ka loute u’leh ka grep huonte uh midangten atangta uhi,” chi zong a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Akikouna u’leh tam thute a alungkim lounate uh ka zahtah in ka lungthah mamata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachia, ka kingaituo zouin, miliente leh vaihawmte ka phawh a, akung uah, “Nouten na unaute uh tungah apung dei in sum na batlah sah uhi,” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n atungthu uh ngaituo dingin kikhopna thupitah khat ka bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken akung uah, “Namdangte kung a kizua i unau Judate ithei kham kham un inua tatdoh kiata uhi, hinanleh tuin nouten inua tat kia dingin na unaute mama uh na zua uhi,” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n amauh gen ding theilouin asipta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n akung uah, “Na sil bawlte uh ahoi sih hi. I melma namdangte hing simmawna ipel theina dinga, Pasian zau kawma na gamtat ding uh hilou ahiei mah ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuathamlouin kei leh ka sanggamte leh ka nna semten zong sumtang leh bu leh balte mite ka leitawi sah uhi. Hinanleh tambanga sumpung lah pen itawpsan ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuni mama in, aloute uh, agrep huonte uh, a Olivehuonte u’leh ainnte uh, tualeh asumpungte, u’leh abu leh balte u’leh a uointe u’leh, a sathaute uh, mun seza suo sekhat pung na lahte zousie uh nua pieh kia un,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun, “Na gen bangin ka pe kia ding ua, ama ua kipat bangma ka phut sih ding uhi,” achi uhi. Tuachi’n akichiemna bang ua kihahsielna bawl sah dingin siempute ka han hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka puontuol kihipte ka thinga; “A thuchiem tangtunlou mi pouma, Pasian in tambang in, ainn leh anei alam apat in, thing sieng henlen, Tambangma in thinkhieh leh aguohin um heh” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n mipi kikhawmte zousie in “Amen” achi ua, Mangpa aphat uhi. Tuachi’n mipiten athuchiemna bangun abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Artekserses leenga apan kum sawmnina kum a, Juda gam uhpipa dinga guota ka um akipat, akum sawmthum leh ni na dong, kum sawm leh kum ni sung, kei leh ka unaute koima’n uhpipa tan dinga kiguot ann kane sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei masanga uhpipa a na pang masaten, mipite tungah puohgih ana guon uh a, amaute akipat in tanghou leh uain ban ah dangka shekel sawmli ana lah zel ban uah, asuohte uh nasan zong mipite tungah ana kiliensah mama uhi. Hinanleh Kenvang Pasian giinna ziehin tuabangin kabawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuanahsangin tami kulbang lamna ah ka kipumpieh ua, gam mawngmawng ka lei sih ua, tualeh ka mi nasemte zousie tua nasepna mun ah akisukhawm zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuathamlouin ka kim ka vel ua um namdangte lah a kipat a, ka kung ua hing peite chilou Juda mite leh milien leh vaihawmte za le sawm nga in ka dawkan ah ka annkuong a im uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin ka nichin neh dinga kibawl khu, bawngtal khat, belamtal thau tah guh leh Aate ahing bawlpieh zel ua, ni sawm dan in savun zuthawl in uoin kichingtah in ahing kipie hi, hinanleh tam mipite tung gih ahizieh in, Ken uhpipa a dinga kiguotsa annte ka phut ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian tam mite a dinga ka sil bawl zousiete, dungzui in ka hoina dingin hing thei ngitnget in aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuahunlaiin, akotpite ah kotkhate vaw nai sih nanleng kulbaang lam ka zouta a, ahawmte ka hubit zouta chi, Sanballat leh Tobiah leh Arab mi Geshem tualeh ka melmate zousie in azah tah un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sanballat leh Geshem in thu ahing hah ua, “Hing pei in Ono phaijanga khuo khat ah ikimu ding uhi,” ahing chi uhi. Hinanleh ka tunga sil hoilou bawl tum ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken nna thupitah sem ka hi a, ka hing pei suh thei sih hi, “Tam ka nasep nuasie a, noute kunga kahing pei kaal a, bang dinga nasep khawl ding ahiei mah? chiin amaute kungah mi ka sawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Livei tah tam thu ka kungah ahing hah ua, Ken zong ka dawn ngai bangin ka dawng zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sanballat in anga veina dingin asuohpa, khutah laihah honsa tawi in, athu kibangmama puo in ka kungah ahing sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua laihah sungah; “Nang leh Judaten hel na sawm zieh ua, kulbangte na bawl uh ahi chi namte lah ah athanga, tualeh Geshem in zong ahing gen hi. Tualeh thutut kiza dan in nang khu aleengpa uh hi ding na lunggul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda gam ah leeng khat a um, chia Jerusalem a nangma tungtang phuongzah dingin guolneite nangawn na guotta hi, tam thute dungzui in leengpa kungah hil ahi ding ahi. Tuaziehin hing pei inlen, iki kum ding hi,” chi’n aki giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n, “Ken na genbanga sil kibawl bangma aum sih hi, hinanleh nangma lungsim a, na phuo tawm thu ahi bou hi,” chi’n mi ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen, ama uten, “Anasep uh alawchin louna ding un akhutte uh suhzoi in um heh, chia ngaituo a ahing suhzau sawm ahi uhi.” Hinanleh, Aw Mangpa tuin ka khutte hing suhhat pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni khat, Mehetabeel tupa Delaiah tapa Shemaiah umna inn ah Kava haw a, tualeh aman, “Pasian biehinn sungah kimu vai in, biehinn kotte ki khakhum vai, aziehpen nangma that dinga zanlai a hing pei ding ahi uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh Ken, “Kei bang mi ataimang ngai amah? Tualeh Kei bang mi koi ahiei ahinna humbitna dinga biehinn sunga tailut ding? ka lut sih ding hi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n, ama Pasian sawl ahi sih a, Tobiah leh Sanballat in ana gol guh uh ahia, ka sietna dinga thumavang gen ahi, chi ka theikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama Kei hing zau sah a, tualeh khelna bawl sah a ahing suhminsiet theina ding u’leh, ahing simmaw theina ding ua, ana gol guh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian, Sanballat leh Tobiah, tualeh guolneinu Noadiah leh guolnei dangte, kei hing suhzau tumte nasepna dungzuiin amaute thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elul ha ni sawmni leh ni nga ni, ni sawm nga leh ni ni sungin kulbang akilamzou siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka melmate un tam thu azahtah u’leh, tam nasep ka zouta uh chi, ka kim ka vel ua namte zousie in amu tah un, ka Pasian uh silbawl ahi chi a thei ua, akimuong ngam nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuathamlouin khum hunlai a, Juda milienten Tobiah kungah laihah tampi ana hah hahta uhi, tualeh Tobiah laihah zong amauh kungah ana tung zel zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen Tobiah khu Ara tupa Shekaniah a ding in amahpa ahi ziehin Juda gam a mitampite Tobiah panpi dinga thuchiem a kigahsa ana hita ua, tualeh Tobiah tapa Jehonanan in Berekiah tapa Meshullam tanu akitenpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh amauten Tobiah nasep hoite zong ka kungah agen ua, tualeh ka thugente zong ama kungah ana tutzel uhi, tuazieh a Tobiah in kei hing suhzau tum a, laihahte ahing hah zel ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n a kulbaangte ahing kilam zoutah in, kotpi kotkhate ka tunding zou in, kotkha vengmite, lasamite leh Levimite akiguot zou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sanggampa Hanani Jerusalem uhpipa in ka bawl a, mi tamtahte sanga mi ginum leh Pasian giingmi ahi ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh amaute kungah, “Vaihamsang ahi masang siein Jerusalem kotpite hong sih un, kotpi vengten aven laisie uh kotpite khasa leh kilsa a koi ding ahi. Jerusalem a tengte zong galvengmi in guot unlen, pawl khatte amauh pan mun dinga kiguotna mun ah, pawl dangte amauh inn mai chiet ah pangsah un,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khopi agol a, alien hi, hinanleh asunga teng mite atawm a, innte zong akilam nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka Pasian in miliente leh vaihawm mite tualeh mipite, akhanggui uh dung zui a, min khum dinga khopkhawm ding lungsim ahing nei sah hi. Tualeh Sal tanna akipata hing kile masate khangthu sutna laibu ka mukhie a, tuana kigielte tambang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Babilon leengpa Nebukadnezzar in sal a apuimang saltanna gam a kipat a hing kile kia a, Jerusalem leh Juda gam a, michin amauh khuo chiet a, peitou a, khum gam a umte, tamte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute khu, Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordekai, Bilshan Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum, Baanah, ahi ua, tamte toh hing zawhkhawm, Israel mipite tam dan, tam bang ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Parosh hahlesuonte, tul ni leh zakhat leh sawm sagi leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Shephatiah hahlesuonte zathum leh sawm sagi leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arah hahlesuonte zaguh leh sawmnga leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jeshua leh Joab khanggui apat Pahath-Moab hahlesuonte tul ni leh zagiet leh sawm leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elam hahlesuonte tul khat leh zani leh sawmnga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zattu hahlesuonte zagiet leh sawm li leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zakkai hahlesuonte zasagi leh sawmguh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Binnui hahlesuonte zaguh leh sawm li leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bebai hahlesuonte zaguh leh sawmni leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azzad hahlesuonte tul ni leh zathum sawmni leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adonikam hahlesuonte zaguh sawmguh leh sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bigvai hahlesuonte tul ni leh sawmguh leh sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adin hahlesuonte zaguh leh sawmnga leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezekiah khanggui a Ater suonte Sawmkuo leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hashum hahlesuonte za thum sawmni leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bezai hahlesuonte zathum sawm sawmni leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hariph hahlesuonte zakhat sawmkhat leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon hahlesuonte Sawmkuo leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bethlehem leh Netophah mite zakhat sawmgiet leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth mite zakhat sawmni leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Beth Azmaveth mite sawm li leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kiriath Jearim, Kephirah leh Beeroth mite zasagi sawmli leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ramah leh Geba mite zaguh sawmni leh khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mikmash mite zakhat sawmni leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bethel leh Ai mite zakhat sawmni leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nebo danga mite sawmnga leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elam danga mite tulkhat zani sawmnga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harim mite zathum leh sawmni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jerikou mite zathum leh sawmli leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lod, Hadid leh Ono mite zasagi sawmni leh khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Senaah mite tulthum zakuo leh sawmthum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Siempute: Jeshua khang gui a kipat Jedaiah hahlesuonte zakuo sawmsagi leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Imer hahlesuonte tulkhat leh sawmnga leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pashur hahlesuonte tulni leh sawmli leh sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Harim hahlesuonte tulkhat leh sawm leh sagi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Levimite: Kadmiel leh Hodaviah khanggui apata Jeshua hahlesuonte sawmsagi leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lasamite: Asaph hahlesuonte zakhat sawmli leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kotpi vengte: Shallum, Ater, Talmon, Akkub, Hatita leh Shobal hahlesuonte zakhat sawmthum leh giet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Biehinn nasemte: Ziha tate, Hasuph tate, Tabbaoth tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Keros tate, Sia tate, Padontate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lebanah tate, Hagaba tate, Shalmai tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hanan tate, Giddel tate, Gahar tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Reaiah tate, Rezin tate, Nekoda tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gazzam tate, Uzza tate, Paseah tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Besai tate, Meunim tate, Nephusesim tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bakbuk tate, Hakupha tate, Harhur tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bazluth tate, Mehida tate, Harsha tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Barkos tate, Sisera tate, Temah tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Neziah tate leh Hatipha tate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Solomon suohte hahlesuonte. Sotai tate, Sophereth tate, Perida tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jaala tate, Darkon tate, Giddel tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Shephatiah tate, Hattil tate, Pokereth-Hazebaim tate leh Amon tate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Biehinn nasemte leh Solomon suohte hahlesuonte, zathum leh sawmkuo leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tam mite, Tel-Melah, Tel-Harsha, Kerub, Addon, leh Immer a kipata hing peitoute ahi ua, hinanleh amaun apu leh pate uh khang gui leh Israel mi ahina uh khanggui asut thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Delaiah tate, Tobiah tate leh Nikoda tate, zaguh sawmli leh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Siempute lah a kipat in, Hobaiah tate, Hakkoz tate leh Barzillai (Tam Barzillai pen mi khat, Gilead mi Barzillai tanu akitenpi zieh a Gilead mipa min a kihan, Barzillai) hahlesuonte ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tam miten amauh be le phung khang gui kigelna laibu asui ua, hinanleh amu zou sih uhi, tuazieh in asienglou banga ngai ahi ua, siempu hina apat koidoh ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tuazieh in uhpipan amaute Urim leh thumim zanga siempu nasem ahimasangsie uh, ann siengpen aneh lou ding uh ahi, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Mipi kikhawmte abawn un tul sawmli leh tul ni zathum sawm guh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Asuoh pasal te u’leh asuoh numeite uh tul sagi zathum leh sawm thum leh sagi te simlou ahi nalai hi. Amaun pasal leh numei lasa mi zani leh sawmli leh nga anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Amaun sakol zasagi leh sawm thum leh guh leh sakol neu zani leh sawmli leh nga leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />sangawngsau zali sawm thum leh nga leh sabiltung tulguh leh zasagi leh sawmni anei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tuin akhang gui dung zui ua aphung sung ua upa pente pawl khat in nasepna dingin athaw uh hi. Gam uhpipan sum koina ah sana darik tul khat, maiphietna kuong sawm nga leh siempu puonsil zanga leh sawm thum, apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Phung sunga upa pen pawl khat in inn lamna dingin sum koina ah, sana darik tul sawmni leh dangka mina tul ni leh zani apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Midangte pieh kigawm khawm sana darik tul sawmni leh dangka mina tul ni leh siempu puonsil sawm guh leh sagi apha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Tuachi’n, siempute, Levimite, kotpi vengte, lasa mite leh midang pawl khat leh Biehinn nasemte leh Israel mizousie amauh khopi chiet ah atengta uhi. Aha sagi na ah Israelte zousie amauh khopi chiet ah ateng det chietta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipi zousie mi khat bang mai a kithutuohin Tui kotpi mai a mun awng ah akikhawm ua, laigielpa Ezra kungah, Mangpa’n Israelte kungah athupieh Mosi dan laibu hing tawi dingin ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n ha sagina ani khat ni in, siempu Ezra in mipi kikhawm pasal leh numeite leh thu ngaikhe thei zousiete mai ah danbu ahing tawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman zingmawng phalvah apat sun dong tua Tui kotpi mai a mun awng lam ngat in pasalte leh numeite tualeh thutheisiem zousie mai ah asimkhie a, mipi zousie in dan laibu kisim khu lunglut lahin angaikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Laigielpa Ezra tuami dinga kibawl dawkan tungah adinga, aziet lam pang ah Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uria, Hilkiah leh Maaseiah, ading ua, Aveilam pangah, Pedaiah, Mishael, Malkijah, Hashum, Hashbaddanan, Zekariah leh Meshullam, ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ezra mipite sanga sangzaw in adinga, mipite zousie mitmu ah laibu aphen a, tua laibu aphen laitahin mipite ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ezra in Mangpa Pasian thupitah khu aphat a tualeh mipi zousie’n akhut uh zahtou in, “Amen, Amen,” chiin adawng uhi. Tuachi’n alu uh akun sah ua, amai ua tuol su in Mangpa abie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Jeshua, Bani, Sherebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Shabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozbad, Hanan, Pelaiah leh Levimiten danthu atheisiemna dingun ahilchien ua, mipite amauh mun chiet ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten Pasian dan laibu kichientah in asimkhie ua, aum zie ahilchien ua, laibu kisim khu athei siemsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh gam uhpipa Nehemiah leh siempu leh laigielpa Ezra leh mipite hil apang Levimiten mipite zousie kungah, “Tuni khu Mangpa na Pasian ua dingin ni siengthou ahi, daa sih unlen, kap sih un” achi uhi. Aziehpen mipite zousie in dan thute a zahtah un akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Nehemiah in akung uah, “Pei unlen ann tuitui ne unlen, uoin hum dawn unlen, bangma kiguot piehloute adingin tanvou hah un aziehpen tuni khu i Mangpa ua dingin ni siengthou ahi, hase sih un, aziehpen Mangpa lungdamna khu na hatna uh ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levimiten mipite zousie kungah, “Dai dide un, tuni khu ni siengthou ahi ziehin, hase sih un,” chin mipite zousie asip sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite ne ding leh dawn dingin leh tanvoute hah ding leh lungkim tah a, guolnuom dingin apeita uhi. Aziehpen akung ua kiphuongkhie thute atheisiemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani ni niin mipite zousie apu leh pate uh innkuon dungzui a aphungsung ua upa pente leh siempute leh Levimite toh laigielpa Ezra kungah danthute zil dingin ahing pei khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Mangpa’n Mosi zanga thu apieh dan laibu ah, ha sagina pawi sungin, Israel tate hampheng buh sunga a um ding uh ahi, chi leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Taang gamte ah pei unlen, Olive singbate, gamlah Olive singbate, mui singbate, tumnate leh sawlbawh phate danlai bu a kigiel banga hampheng buhte bawlna dingin vala un,” chiin akhuote u’leh Jerusalem ah phuong zah unlen tangkou un chia, thu kigielte amukheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite akuonkhie ua, singbate ava puo ua, michin in a inntung chiet u’leh, ahuong sung leituol chiet leh Pasian inn huong leituol leh Tui, kotpi mai a mun awng ah, tualeh Ephraim kotpi kunga mun awng ah hampheng buhte alamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh saltanna pat a hing kile kia mipi kikhawmte zousiete in hampheng buh abawl uhi, aziehpen Nun tapa hunlai akipat tuami ni tandongin, Israel taten tuabangin pawi abawl ngai sih uhi. Tualeh akipahna uh alien mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni masa pen akipat ani tawpna dongin, Ezra in Pasian dan laibu asim zing hi. Tualeh amaun ni sagi pawi amang ua, angaina dungzui in ni giet ni in khawmpi siengthou anei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami ha, ni sawmni leh ni li niin, Israel mipite ann ngawl leh sai ip puon silin leh alu tung ua leivui kibuoh khum in ahing kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte khu gamdang mite zousie akipat akikhen kheta ua, tualeh adingdoh ua, akhelnate u’leh apu apate uh gitloutatnate aphuongkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A umna mun chiet uah a ding ua, ni khat seli suo sekhat sung Mangpa a Pasian uh Dan laibu simna in azang ua, seli suo sekhat sung dang pen, khelna thupha tawina leh Mangpa a Pasian uh biehna in azang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n dawkan tungah Levi mite, Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Shebaniah, Bunni, Sherebiah, Bani leh Kenani adingtou ua, Mangpa a Pasian u’kungah aw ngaitah in akikouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levimite Jeshua, Kadmiel, Bini, Hashabneiah, Sherebiah, Hodiah, Shebaniah leh Pethahiah ten mipite kungah, “Dingtou unlen, Mangpa na Pasian u’khu kumtawn kumtawn in phat un, tualeh phatna pahtawina zousie tunglam a tawisanga um na min thupi phat in umta hen.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Ezra in, “Nangma bou Mangpa na hia, nangman vante van leh asunga um zousiete, lei leh leitunga um zousiete, tualeh tuipi leh asunga um zousiete na siem a, amaute zousie kungah hinna na pie a, van a um zousieten nangma ahing bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma Abram telpa leh Kaldaimite khopi Ur a kipat a puidohpa leh Abraham chi a min phuopa Mangpa Pasian na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh na masangah alungtang muonhuoiin na muta a, tuachi’n, Kanaanmite, Hitmite, Amormite, Perezmite, Jebusmite leh Girgashmite, gam ahahlesuonte kunga pe dingin ama toh thuhun na bawl a, tualeh na thu na sutangtungta hi, dihtattah na hi zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tualeh Izipt gam a ka pu ka pate uh thuohgimna na mu a, tuipi san gei a akaa leh maunate u’zong na za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pharaoh tungah leh asuohte tungah, tualeh gam sunga mi zousie tungah, chiemtenate leh sil lamdangte na kilang sah hi, aziehpen amaun simmawhuoitahin ka pu ka pate uh ana bawlsie uh chi na thei a, tuni tandong a aum bangin na min na kitheisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh tuipi lai a lei gaw a apei theina dingun, tuipi khu phalni in na kikhentan sah a, tualeh amauh nuadelte tuipi thuhtah sungah suongtum bangin na pailutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuathamlouin, sun in amaute meilum khuom in na pui a, zan in, apeina lampite uh tanvah dingin mei kuong ding in amauh na pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sinai muol ah zong na hing kum suh a, amauh van a kipat in na houpi a, vaihawmna dihtahte, dan dihtahte, thugousie leh thupieh hoitahte, amauh na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh akung uah na khawlni siengthoute na theisah a, Na suoh Mosi zangin akung uah, thusete leh thugousiete, tualeh danthute, azah ding un na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Agilkiel chiengun van a pat in amauh tanghou na pie a, adangta chiengun ama ua dingin suongpi apat in tui na pawtdoh sah hi, tualeh amauh pieh dinga na kichiemna gam luo dinga pei ding in thuchiem na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hinanleh ama u’leh ka pu leh pate un, kisatheitah leh ngawng vaipuohin agamta ua, na thupiehte azui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu amang nuom sih ua, alah ua na sil lamdang bawlte zong angaituo ut sih uhi. Hinanleh a ngawng uh akhau sah ua, agenha ua, Izipt gam a asaltanna ua kile kia ding asawm zaw uhi. Hinanleh Nang pen ngaidam dinga mansa, hepina hau, khotuona adim, lungthah paipailou leh it siem Pasian na hi a, amauh na taisan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi, bawngnou sunthu lim abawl ua, Izipt gam a kipat a noute hing puidoh, na Pasian uh tami ahi, chi a, Nang ahing minsietsah ua, nahpitah a Pasian agensiet lai nangawn un zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na hepina alet seng zieh in, amaute gamdai ah na taisan sih hi, sun a amauh puitu meilum khuom in lah amauh ataisan sih a, tualeh apeina ding ua vah pe dinga zan a puitu mei kuong dingin zong ataisan tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaute hil dingin, na hagau hoitah na pie a, Nangman akam ua pat na manna na taangsah den sih a, adangta chieng un tui na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kum sawmli sung gamdai gamgaw ah amaute na vah a, Bangma atasam sih uhi. Apuonsilte uh ase sih a, akengte uh zong apawm ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh leeng gamte leh namte amauh na pie a, gam, ningkawm teng zong na hawm pieh a, tuachi’n amaun, Heshbon leengpa Sihon gam leh Bashan leengpa Og gamte aluota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahah asuonte uh van a aasite bangin na pung sah a, apu apate u’kunga va luo dinga na gensa gam ah na puilutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahahasuonte uh ava lut ua, aluota uhi. Nang amaute masangah tua gam ateng Kanaan mite na sungiemta a, tua gam mite leh aleengte uh, a ut ut ua abawl ding un, amaute khut sungah ana pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amauten kulpi nei khopite leh gam hoite ala ua, sil hoi a dim innte, tuikhuh tawsate, grep huonte, Olive huonte leh theikung tampite aluota uhi. Tuachi’n ane ua, nieng leh tai in aum ua, ahing thauta uhi. Tuachi’n na hoina thupitah zal zouin akipah mamata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Ahivang in thu amang sih ua, Na tungah a helta ua, na dan anuangatsan ua, Nang lam a ahing kiheina ding ua, amaute phawhhilna thugen na guolneite athat ua, nasatah in ahing lungthahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute amelmate uh khutah na pekhie a, amauten asugenthei uhi. Tuachi’n agenthei hun chieng ua, nang ahing hat chiengun, van apat in na za a, na khotuona thupitah ziehin, amelmate khut ua pat a hundam dingin mi na pe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanleh akhawldam zou chiengun, na masangah silgilou abawl zel uhi. Tuazieh in nang amaute amelmate uh khut ah na nuasie zel a, tuachi’n amaun atung uah thu aneikhum zel uhi, ahivangin ahing kinuahei kia ua, nang ahing hat chiengun, van akipat in na za a, na khotuonate ziehin tam veipi amauh na hunkhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na dan lam a amauh na puilut kia theina dingin adihlouna uh na theisah hi. Hinapiin kisathei tahin agamta ua, na thupiehte azui sih ua, hinanleh na vaihawmnate kalin akhiel ua, tuate mi’n azui leh, hing ding ahi bou hi. Tualeh aliengkou uh asawisah ua, angawng uh avaipuoh ua, aza nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hinanleh kum tampi amaute na thuohzou a, na guolneite zang in na hagau in amaute dihlounate uh na theisah a, hinanleh angaikhe nuom sih uhi. Tuaziehin amaute agam mite khut ah na pekheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hinanleh na khotuona aletseng ziehin amauh na sugam sih a, na taisan tuom sih hi, aziehpen nang hepina hau leh khotuo siem Pasian na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tuin, ka Pasian uh, thuhun leh itna dettah a vomzing, Pasian thupi leh hat leh giinhuoi ka tung u’leh ka leengpate utung leh kapu leh pate u’leh na mipite zousie tunga, Assiria leengte hunlai apata tuni tandonga hing tung hasatnate zousie, na masangah sil neunoukhat bangin hing gel pieh sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bangteng hitaleh ka tung ua sil hing tung zousie ah, nang na dih hi; aziehpen nangma’n dihtah in na bawla, hinanleh kouten giloutah in ka bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka leengpate u’leh, ka miliente uh, ka siempute u’leh kapu leh pate un na dan azui sih ua, na thupiehte leh amauh kal a na gen na thu theisahnate zong angaikhe nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Atung ua na hoina thupitah zieh a gam lien leh hausa tah napiehna, aleenggam sung nangawn uah, nangma nna asem ut sih ua, a nasep gilou ua pat in akihei kia ut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuni in tam gam ah suoh leh sal ka hita uh, ngaivawi kapu ka pate un, agam gate leh asilhoite aneh ua nuom asah theina ding ua na piehna gam sungah suoh leh sal, ka hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka khelnate zieh ua, ka tung ua leengpa dinga na guotten ahausat lawta ua, Amauten ka tahsa pumpite u’leh ka gantate uh tungah a ut dan dan un thu anei ua, gentheitahin ka umta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tamte zousie zieh in, thuchiem dettah bawl in ka giel ua, ka lamkaite uh, ka Levite u’leh, ka siempute un, anamkip uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua thuchiem namdetna suoi bawlte tamte ahi uhi: Hakaliah tapa Nehemiah gam uhpipa leh Zedekiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pashur, Amariah, Malkijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hattush, Shebaniah, Malluk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meshullam, Abijah, Mijamin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maaziah, Bilgai, Shemaiah, tamte khu siempute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levimite: Ajaniah tapa Jeshua, Henadad tate lah ah Binnui leh Kadmiel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aseppite uh: Shebaniah, Hodijah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mika, Rehob, Hashabiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zakkur, Sherebiah, Shebaniah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hodijah, Bini, Beninu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipite lamkaite: Parosh, Pahath-Moab, Elam, Zattu, Bani.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bunni, Azgad, Bebai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hodiah, Hashum, Bezai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hariph, Anathoth, Nebai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Magpiash, Meshullam, Hezir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshezabeel, Zadok, Jaddua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pellatiah, Hanan, Anaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hoshea, Hananiah, Hashub,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hallohesh, Pileha, Shobek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehum, Hashabnah, Maaseiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahijah, Hanan, Anan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Malluk, Harim, Baanah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Midangte Siempute, Levimite, kotpi vengte, lasa mite, Biehinn a nasemte leh tua gamsung ateng mite lah apat a, Pasian dan zui dinga hing ki koituom zousiete, azite uh, atapate u’leh atanute uh, pilna leh theisiemna nei ten,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amauten a unaute u’leh, amiliente uh azui chinten ua, Pasian suohpa Mosi in apieh, Pasian dan thupieh zui ding leh Mangpa i Mangpa uh thupieh zousiete leh avaihawmna dante leh athugousiete zui ding leh bawl dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka tanute uh, tam gammite kungah ka pe sih ding ua, tualeh ka tapate ua dingin atanute uh kala sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh tam gam miten khawlni a, van ahiei, anntang ahiei, ahing zua u’leh, khawlni in ahiei, ahisihleh ni siengthou ni ahiei in, ka lei pieh sih ding uhi; tualeh kum sagina kum chin in nna semlou ding leh leibate phullou dingin hamse lawna leh kihahsielna ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka Pasian uh inn a, nasepna dingin kum chin a shekel khat sethum suo sekhat pe dingin dan ka siem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tanghou siengthou ading leh ann sillat ngitnget a ding leh halmang sillat ngitnget a ding leh khawlni leh hathate, hun kiguotsa pawite, sil siengthoute, Israel mite a dinga lemna bawlna dinga khelna thoina ding leh ka Pasian uh inn a nasepna zousie a dingin ka pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dan laibu a kigiel banga, Mangpa i Pasian uh maitam tunga hal ding, kum chin a ahun kiguot bang zel a, apu apate uh innkuon dungzui a sing sillat, Mangpa i Pasian uh inn a hing polut dingin, siempute, Levimite leh mipite lah ah ai ka san zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kum chin a i loua pieng ga masa pente leh sing zousie gam a sa pente zousie, Mangpa inn a tawi chiet ding chiin danthu ka bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Dan laibu a kigiel bangin, ka tapate lah ua pieng masa pente leh ganhonte lah a pieng masa pente tualeh belamhon leh kelhon lah a pieng masah pente zong, Pasian inn a nasem siempute kunga tawi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka Pasian uh inn dantan sunga siempute kungah ka tangbuong meh masa pente, i sillalte, sing kunga ka thei ga masa pente zousie uh, ka uoin thate u’leh, ka sathau masa pente u’leh, ka lou ua ga masa sawm a khatte, Levite kungah ka hing tawi uhi, tua Leviten ka tenna uh khopi sungte ua, sawm a khat atan theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh siempute’n sawm a khat alah chiengun Aaron hahlesuon siempu khat Levimite toh a um khawm ding hi. Tualeh Levimiten sawm a khat khu i Pasian uh inn pindan sungah atawilut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aziehpen, Israel mite leh Israel taten, bu, uoin tha leh sathau sillatte, mun siengthou a bel leh kuongte, lasamite umna pindan sunga ahing tawilut ding uh ahi, tualeh eiten i Pasian uh inn i nuasie lou ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin mipi lamkaite Jerusalem ah ateng ua, tualeh midangten khopi siengthou Jerusalem a teng dingin, mipi sawm lah a khat hing pui dingin leh sekuote khu khopi dangte a teng dingin, ai asan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipiten amauh ut thu a Jerusalem a teng dinga deitelna bawlte aguolzawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamte pen gamkai khat a lamkai, Jerusalem a tengte ahi uhi; hinanleh Juda gam a khopite ah michin anei alam utoh amauh tenna ding khopi chiet ah ateng uhi, tuate khu Israel mite, siempute, Levimite leh biehinn nasemte, tualeh Solomon suohte hahlesuonte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem ah Juda hahlesuon pawlkhat leh Benjamin hahlesuonte ateng uhi. Juda mite lah apat in: Perez hahlesuonte lah ah Mahalalel tapa Shephatiah, Shephatiah tapa Amariah, Amariah tapa Zekariah, Zekariah tapa Uzziah, Uzziah tapa Athaiah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Shilon mite hahlesuon lah ah, Zekariah tapa Joiarib, Joiarib tapa Adaiah, Adaiah tapa Hazaiah, Hazaiah tapa Kol-Hozeh, Kol-Hozeh tapa Baruk, Baruk tapa Maaseiah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Perez hahlesuon Jerusalem a tengte zousie mihangsan ngen, zali leh sawmguh leh giet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jeshaiah tapa, Ithiel tapa Maaseiah, Maaseiah tapa Kolaiah, Kolaiah tapa Pedaiah, Pedaiah, tapa Joed, Joed tapa Meshullam, Meshullam tapa Sallu ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh asanggamte, Gabbai, Sallai, mi za kuo leh sawmni leh giet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zikri tapa Joel khu nasepna lam entuppa ahi, Hassenuah tapa Juda khu khopi tunga vaihawm nina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siempute lah apat: Joiarib tapa Jedaiah leh Jakin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahitub tapa Meraioth, Meraioth tapa Zadok, Zadok tapa Meshullam, Meshullam tapa Hilkiah, Hilkiah tapa Seraiah khu Pasian biehinn a vaihawmpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh tua inn a anaseppi asanggamte khu za giet leh sawmni leh ni ahi uhi, tualeh Malkijah tapa Pashur, Pashur tapa Zekariah, Zekariah tapa Amzi, Amzi tapa Pelaliah, Pelaliah tapa Jeroham, Jeroham tapa Adaiah leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />anaseppite apulepate uh innkuon aphung sung atulpipate utoh abawn un, zani leh sawmli leh ni apha uhi. Tualeh Immer tapa Meshillemoth, Meshillemoth tapa Ahzai, Ahzai tapa Azareel, Azareel tapa Amashai leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />anaseppite uh gal hangsan ngentang za leh sawmni leh giet ahi uhi. Amauh entuppa khu Haggedolim tapa Zabdiel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levimite lah apat: Bunni tapa Hashabiah, Hashabiah tapa Azrikam, Azrikam tapa Hashub, Hashub tapa Shemaiah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levi mite lamkai Shabathai leh Zozabad in Pasian inn pulam nasepna entup in apang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Asaph tapa Zabdi, Zabdi tapa Mika, Mika tapa Mataniah te khu kipah thugenna thumna lamkai leh pantu ahi uhi, tualeh Bakbukiah khu anaseppi a unaute lah a anina ahi a, tualeh Jeduthun tapa Galal, Galal tapa Shammua, Shammua tapa Abda ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khopi siengthou a Levimite zousie zani leh sawm giet leh li ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kotpi vengte lah apat in tamte ahi uhi. Akkub, Talmon leh aseppi asanggamte uh kotpi vengte za leh sawmsagi leh ni ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Israel dangte leh siempute leh Levimite khu Juda khopite zousie ah, michin amauh gouluona mun chiet ah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh Biehinn nasemte pen Ophel ah ateng ua, tualeh Ziha leh Gispa khu biehinn nasemte tungah vaihawm in apang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem a Levimite entupa pang, Bani tapa Uzzi ahia, Bani khu Hashabiah tapa ahia, Hashabiah khu Mattaniah tapa ahia, Mattaniah khu Mika tapa ahia, Uzzi pen Asaph hahlesuonte lah a khat ahia, tualeh Asaph hahlesuonte pen Pasian inn a lasa a nasemte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amauh tungtang thu ah leengpa thupieh ahileh lasamite nichin a neh leh tah atulmaw bangbang ua pieh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Juda tapa Zerah hahlesuonte lah a Meshezabeel tapa Pethahiah khu mipite tungtang thu toh kisai a, leengpa khut nuoi a, thu zousie saipa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh akho neute u’leh aloute u’toh, Juda tate pawlkhat Kiriath-Arba leh a kho neute uah, tualeh Dibon leh akho neute uah leh Jekabzeel leh akho neute uah ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Jeshua, Moladah, Beth-pelet ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-Shual, Beersheba leh akim a kho neute ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziglag, Mekona leh akim a kho neute ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En-rimmon, Zorah ah leh Jarmuth ah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoah, Adullam leh akho neute ah, Lakish leh akim a loute ah, Azekah leh akim a kho neute ah ateng uhi. Tuachi’n Beer-sheba apat in Hinnom phaijang dongin ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin mite zong Geba apat in Mikmash, Aiza, Bethel leh akho neute uah ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Anathoth, Nob, Ananiah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor, Ramah, Gittaim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid, Zeboim, Nebalath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod leh Ono, khutsiemte phaihawm ah ateng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Juda gam a um Levimi pawl khenkhatte zong Benjamin mite toh ateng khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tamte khu Shealtiel tapa Zerubbabel leh Jeshua toh hing kinuale siempute leh Levimite ahi uhi, Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amariah, Malluk, Hattush,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Shekaniah, Rehum, Meremoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Iddo, Ginnethon, Abijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mijamin, Moadiah, Bilgah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Shemaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah leh Jedaiah. Tamte khu Jeshua damlai a siempute leh anaseppi lamkaite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Levimite khu, Jeshua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Sherebiah, Juda leh Mattaniah zong ahi ua, amaute leh anaseppi aunaute un, lungdam thugen a lasahna ah ma akai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute toh kimai ngat in, Bakbukiah leh aseppi a unaute nasem in ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeshua in Joiakim ahinga, Joiakim in Eliashib ahing hi, tualeh Eliashib in Joiada ahing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada in Jonathan ahinga, Jonathan in Jaddua ahing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joiakim damlai a apu leh pate uh innkuon dungzui a siempute phung upate: Seraiah phung ah Meraiah, Jeremiah phungah Hananiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ezra phungah Meshullam, Amariah phungah Jehohanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meliku phungah Jonathan; Shebaniah phungah Joseph;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiram phungah, Adna; Meraioth phungah Helkai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Iddo phungah Zekariah, Ginnethon phungah Meshullam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah phungah Zikri, Miniamin leh Moadiah phungah Piltai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bilgah phungah Shammua, Shemaiah phungah Jehonathan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joiarib phungah Mattenai, Jedaiah phungah Uzzi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sallai phungah Kallai; Amok phungah Eber;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hilkiah phung ah Hashabiah; Jedaiah phungah Nethaneel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eliashib, Joiada, Johanan leh Juddua te damlai a, Levimite leh siempute aphung sung ua tulpipa pente Persia leengpa Darius vaihawm lai donga, khanggui sutna laibu ah amin uh akikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eliashib tapa Johanan damlai dongin Levi tapate pu leh pate tulpipa pente khu khanggui sutna laibu ah amin uh akikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Levimite lamkaite, Hashabiah, Sherebiah leh Kadmiel tapa Jeshua leh a unaute utoh, Pasian mipa David thupieh dung zui a, Kimaingat a apawl pawla, kikhel zel a, phatna leh lungdam thu gen dinga umte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Meshallum, Talmon leh Akkub te khu kotpi bul a van koikhawmna inn leh kotkha vengte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tamte khu Jozadak tapa, Jeshua tapa Joiakim damlai leh uhpipa Nehemiah leh siempu leh laigielpa Ezra damlai a um ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem kulbang latna ah Levimite a tena mun chiet ua pat a suikhie a, kipahtah a lungdamthu genna leh lasah toh, dahkhutbehte, kaiging guineite leh pehgingte thuo a kipahtah a, kulbang latna lawm dingin Jerusalem ah ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lasa pawlte zong Jerusalem kimvel gam a kipat leh Netophath mite khoneute a kipat in ahing kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Beth-gilgal akipat leh Geba gamkai akipat leh Azmaveth gam akipan in zong lasa pawlte ahing peikhawm uhi, aziehpen lasa pawlten, Jerusalem kim ah tenna ding khuote ana satta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Siempute leh Levimite akisiensuo zou tah un, mipite leh kotpite tualeh kulbangte asiensuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken Juda lamkaite kulbang tungah ka zawpitou a, nuomthu gen kawm a kholai nawh dingin pawl lientah ni ka guot a, Pawlkhatte ziet lang panga kulbang tungah, eehvum kotpi lam zuon in akizui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Hoshaiah leh Juda lamkai kim khatten amaute azui ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azariah, Ezra, Meshullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Juda, Benjamin, Shemaiah leh Jeremiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tualeh pengkul tawi siempu khanglai pawlkhat: Jonathan tapa Zakaria, Jonathan khu Shemaiah tapa ahia, Shemaiah khu Mattaniah tapa ahia, Mattaniah khu Mikaiah tapa ahia, Mikaiah pen Zakkur tapa ahia, tualeh Zakkur khu Asaph tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh a unaute, Shemaiah, Azareel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethaneel, Juda leh Hanani ahi ua, Pasian mipa David in ana guotsa bangin tumgingte atawi ua, tualeh laigielpa Ezra in ma apui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuikhuh kotpi apat in ama zawn ua, David khopi kaltouna kalbi ah kulbang tunglam kalna ah akaltou ua, David inntung zawn a Tui kotpi suolam ah apei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nuomthu gen lapawl dangte veilam pang manaw in akizui ua, Ken mipi kimkhatte toh kulbang tungah amauh ka zuitou hi, Meikhuh innsang tunga kulbang lienpi tan ka zuitou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ephraim kotpi tunglam, kotpi lui tunglam, Nga kotpi tunglam leh Hananeel innsang leh Zakhat innsanga kipat in, belam kotpi tandong pei ua, suongkul kotpi ah akhawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian inn a nuomthu gen lapawl nite amauh mun chiet ah ading ua, Kei leh vaihawmte kimkhat zong ka ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh siempute Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin, Mikaiah, Elioenai, Zekariah leh Hananiah te zong apengkulte u’toh ading ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Maaseiah, Shemaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malkijah, Elam leh Ezer, zong a um uhi. Tualeh lasamiten a lamkaipa uh Jezrahiah toh ngaitahin la asa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua niin kithoina thupitahin alan ua, Pasian in lungnopna thupitah apieh ziehin akipah mama uhi, numei leh naupangte zong alung nuom mama uhi. Jerusalem a lungnopna husa gamlapi ah zong akiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuami ni in, tuohkhawmte, ga masate leh sawma khatte koikhawmna inndante enkol ding mi a kiguot a, dan in aphut dungzui a, Siempute leh Levimite tanvou ding, khopi kim leh avel loute apat lakhawm dingin zong mi akiguot hi, azieh pen, nasem siempute leh Levimite tungah Judate akipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Lasa mite leh kotpi veng mite’n David leh atapa Solomon thupieh dungzui in a Pasian uh inndan leh kisuhsiengna inndan akem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Aziehpen nidanglai a, David leh Asaph damlai in lasamite lamkai leh Pasian kunga phatna lasahnate leh kipahthu genna dinga lamkaite ana umsa ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tuabangin Israel mite zousie in Zerubbabel damlai leh Nehemiah damlai nite in lasa mite leh kotpi vengmite, adingin nichin a atanvou ding uh apie ua; tualeh Levi mite tanvou ding atuom in akhenkhe zel ua, tuachi’n Leviten zong Aaron hahlesuonte tanvou ding atuom in akhenkhe sawn zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua niin mipite zah in Mosi laibu asimkhie ua, tua sungah Amon mite leh Moab mite koima, Pasian mite kikhopna ah atel ngailou ding uh ahi chi, amudohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun Israelte tanghou leh tui toh ana lamdawn sih ua, hinanleh amauh hamse law dingin Balaam ana guoi zawsop uhi, hinanleh i Pasian un hamsietna khu guolzawlna asuohsah zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipiten tam danthu azahtah un, gamdang mite hahlesuon zousie, Israelte lah a pat in atuom khenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami masangin, siempu Eliashib i Pasian uh inn a vankoina dantante enkoltu ana hi a, ama pen Tobiah toh ana kikhutzop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Tobiah luo dingin inndan lienpi khat, abawl pieh a, tua inndan khu nidanglai a, Levite, lasamite, kotpi vengte leh siempute a dinga ann sillatte, gimnamtuite, um leh belte, bu leh bal sawm khatte, uoin thate, sathaute, koikhawmna a, na ki zang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tambang sil um laitah in, kei pen Jerusalem ah ka um sih hi, aziehpen Babilon leengpa Artekserses vaihawm kum sawmthum leh kum ni kum in, leengpa kungah kava pei a, ni bangza ahiei nuain leengpa phalna ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerusalem ah ka hing pei kia a, Eliashib silbawl hoilou, Pasian inn huong sunga inndan Tobiah apieh thu ka theikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabepin ka lungthah mamata a, tuachi’n Tobiah inn sunga vante zousie, pindan apat in ka paidoh siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n thu ka pie a, pindante a susieng ua, tuachi’n Pasian inn a um leh belte leh ann sillatte leh gimnamtuite ka hing koilut kia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Levi mite tanvou akung uah akipesih chi ka theidohta a, aziehpen Levimite leh Lasamite zousie khu a nasep ding ua a mawpuohnate uh nuasie in amauh lou lam chiet ah akinua tai chietta uh chi zong ka theikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n vaihawmte ka kinielpi a, akung uah, “Bang dinga Pasian biehinn nuasie a um ahiei?” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n amaute ka hankhawm a, amauh mun chiet ah ka umsah kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda mite zousie in bu sawm a khatte, uoin thate leh sathaute van koikhawmna inn ah ahing tawi khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ken van koikhawm na sum kem dingin siempu Shelemiah, laigielpa Zadok levimite lah a khat, Pedaiah ka guot a, tualeh amaute ban ah Mattaniah tapa, Zakkur tapa Hanan ahi, aziehpen amaute mi ginum a ngai ahi uhi, amaute nasep ahileh a unaute lah ua, neh leh taah hawm pieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamte tungtang ah hing thei ngitnget inlen, Aw ka Pasian, tualeh ka Pasian inn a ding leh khuna nasepna dinga ka ka sepzousa ka nasep hoite hing nuoimang pieh sin chi in ka thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua hunlai in, Juda gam ah khawlni a uoin suhna a grep chil a, bute puo a, grep gate, theigate leh vangih chi tuom tuomte, sabiltungte a guongte ka mu a; amauten tam silte zousie khawlni in Jerusalem ah ahing polut uhi. Tuaziehin amaute tua ni a nehletah zua lou dingin ka vauhilta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tai-ar mi Jerusalem khopi a tengten zong nga leh van tuom tuomte ahing polut ua, Jerusalem a Juda mite lah ah khawlni in ahing zua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken Juda miliente ka vauhil a, akung uah, “Khawlni buasah a, na sil hoilou bawlte uh bang chi dan ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Napu leh pate un tambangin abawl ua, i Pasian un eite tung leh tam khopi tungah tam sil hoilou zousie hing tungsah hitalou ahiei mah? Hinapiin nouten khawlni na buasah zieh un Israel tungah thangpaina tamsem na kibelap sah nalai uhi,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khawlni kipat masanga, nitahlam ni himten Jerusalem kotpite aphah tah chienga kotkhate kha ding leh khawlni bei masangsie a kotte honglou ding in thu ka pie a, tualeh khawlni a vante ahing ki puohlut louna dingin ka nasemte pawl khatte kulkotpite veng dingin ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n summet bawlte leh van chi tuom tuom zuate khu khatvei ahiei, nivei ahiei, Jerusalem pulam ah agieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh amaute ka vau a, akung uah, “Bangdinga kulbang bul a gieh na hi uoi? tambanga na bawl kia u’leh, na tung uah khut ha ding ka hi,” ka chi hi. Tua ni akipat in khawl niin ahing peikia nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Ken, khawlni siengthoutaha akitan theina dingin Levite ki susiengthou a, kotpite veng dingin thu ka pie hi. Tuachi’n Ken Aw ka Pasian, tamte ziehin Kei hing thei ngitnget inlen, Na itna thupidan dungzui in hing humbit in, chiin ka thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua hunlaiin, Ashdod, Ammon leh Moab numeite Juda miten zi a akitenpi uh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh atate uh kimkhat Ashdod ham in aham ua, Juda ham in aham theisih uhi, hinanleh nam dang dangte ham in aham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute ka phawh a, hamsie ka lawkhum a, pawlkhatte ka vuo a, ka humsamlai a, asamte uh kabaw khiet pieh hi. “Namdangte tapate adingin na tanute uh na pieh ding uh ahi sih a, na tapate u’leh nouma a dingin zong atanute uh na lah lou ding uh ahi, chiin Pasian min in ka kichiemsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel leengpa Solomon zong tambang numei tunga na gamta khiel hilou ahiei mah? Nam tampite lah ah ama banga Pasian in a it leengpa koima a um sih a, Pasian in ama khu Israelte zousie tunga leengpa ding in abawl a, hinanleh ama ngel zong gamdang numeiten ana khiel sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nouten zong tambanga gamdang numeite kitenpi in tam giltouna thupitah leh i Pasian tunga khelna chizat huoi na bawl uh, chi tuni a ngaikhe ding ka hi uoi mah?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siempulien Eliashib tapa Joiada tapate lah a khat khu Horon mi Sanballat mahpa ana hi a, tuazieh in ama khu ka kunga pat in ka delmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw ka Pasian, amauh thei ngitnget in, aziehpen amaun siempu hina leh siempute leh Levite thuhun a buasahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tambangin Keima’n amaute gamdangmi zousie apat in ka siensuota a, siempute a ding leh Levimite a dingin, michin amauh sep ding chiet ka guot piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh hun bi kiguotsate a, sing sillat ding leh ga masa te ading in zong ka guot hi. Hoina dingin hing thei ngitngetin, Aw Mangpa ka Pasian.
  </para>
</usx>
